  "body": "Currently we put the cancelation reasons into an array. But since tee() was invented, [AggregateError](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/AggregateError) has shipped, which is made for this purpose.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure this is worth the breaking change (especially since it'd be pretty hard to measure usage of the array form), but I thought it'd be worth considering...",
